        "original_id": "cf7edb41-829f-5475-83d9-b3bdd34d8fd4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat, Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, Abby Ryder Fortson\n- Works: Ant-Man, The Kid Who Would Be King, Saturday Night Live\n- Roles: Writer, director, head writer, actress, character\n- Characters: Cassandra Lang, Cassie Lang\n\nFacts:\n- Adam McKay served as head writer for the NBC sketch comedy series Saturday Night Live for two seasons.\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote Ant-Man with Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, and Paul Rudd.\n- Cassie Lang, also known as Cassandra Lang, made her cinematic debut in the 2015 film Ant-Man, where Abby Ryder Fortson portrayed her.\n- The Kid Who Would Be King is an upcoming British-American adventure drama film written and directed by Joe Cornish.\n- Joe Cornish also co-wrote a work with Steven Moffat and Edgar Wright, but the title is not provided in this chunk.",
